# Supabase CLI working state. Not secret, but it records the pooler
# connection string, the DB username, the org id and the exact Postgres,
# GoTrue, PostgREST and Storage versions — free version-fingerprinting for
# anyone reading the repo, and nothing here is worth reviewing in a diff.
